# growfood-skill — Cursor Rules

This project is an AI agent skill for managing Grow Food meal delivery subscriptions.

**Read `SKILL.md` for the full instruction set** — it contains all commands, scenarios,
rules, and behavioral constraints. Follow it exactly.

Key points:
- All actions go through the script: `python3 ./scripts/growfood.py --json <command>`
- Never call API endpoints directly
- Never invoke payment endpoints
- Never bypass captcha
- Respond in Russian, keep it short
- Respect 🔒 days (locked), only modify ✏️ days (editable)
- `--allow-extra` only with explicit user consent per dish
- Token handling: never log, never commit, never echo back to user
